  "description": "Single-storey rear extension 4.7m deep x 3.35m high (3m high to eaves).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed rear extension by reason of size, bulk and location would result in significant harm to the residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers, by giving rise to an unneighbourly loss of daylight, sunlight and outlook, and by creating an overbearing and enclosing relationship with this adjoining properties, including No. 35 Parsonage Gardens. The proposal therefore conflicts with the objectives of Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD 8 and DMD11 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
